    "detailed_description": "Space Adventure - Escape form Siphilus 1b is a point &amp; click adventure with challenging puzzles, funny dialogues and beautiful graphics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOn the search for rare minerals, a not entirely unexpected incident occurs and takes our hero to a foreign planet.<br />\r\nOnce there, he must find a way through the new world to learn more about the planet and the hidden secrets.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis point &amp; click adventure is a rather quiet, chilled game accompanied by a harmonious electronic sound.<br />\r\nThe puzzles aren't easy, so you'll have to put in a little effort.<br />\r\nDon't expect help, you're on your own...as it is in the universe.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Over 30 scenes<br />\r\n- Atmospheric graphics<br />\r\n- Harmonious music<br />\r\n- Tricky puzzles<br />\r\n- In RGB colors<br />\r\n- Convenient verb coin interface<br />\r\n- Controllable with mouse<br />\r\n- Infinite gameplay if you don't finish it<br />\r\n- etc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun!",
    "about_the_game": "Space Adventure - Escape form Siphilus 1b is a point &amp; click adventure with challenging puzzles, funny dialogues and beautiful graphics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOn the search for rare minerals, a not entirely unexpected incident occurs and takes our hero to a foreign planet.<br />\r\nOnce there, he must find a way through the new world to learn more about the planet and the hidden secrets.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis point &amp; click adventure is a rather quiet, chilled game accompanied by a harmonious electronic sound.<br />\r\nThe puzzles aren't easy, so you'll have to put in a little effort.<br />\r\nDon't expect help, you're on your own...as it is in the universe.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Over 30 scenes<br />\r\n- Atmospheric graphics<br />\r\n- Harmonious music<br />\r\n- Tricky puzzles<br />\r\n- In RGB colors<br />\r\n- Convenient verb coin interface<br />\r\n- Controllable with mouse<br />\r\n- Infinite gameplay if you don't finish it<br />\r\n- etc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun!",
